<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Acuson raised to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Acuson raised to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns raised its rating on the shares of Acuson Corp to buy from hold, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 3-7/16 to 26-1/2.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
